  "text": "BluePearl Pet Hospital Queens | Forest Hills, NY\nSkip to the content\nJoin the BluePearl Family!\nWe're hiring.\nFind a Hospital\nSearch the site\nSearch\nSearch the site\nSearch\nResources for Pet Owners\nWhy BluePearl\nIntake Form\nPay with CareCredit\nPet Care Articles and Videos\nStories from the Heart\nResources for Veterinarians\nWhy Refer to BluePearl\nReferral Portal & Medical Records\nOrder BluePearl Materials\nMedical Library for DVMs\nAbout Us\nWho We Are\nOur Areas of Expertise\nNewsroom\nContact Us\nCareers\nFind a Hospital\nHome\nHospitals\nBluePearl Pet Hospital Queens Forest Hills, NY\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nQueens\nForest Hills, NY\n24/7 Emergency and Specialty\n718.263.0099\n107-28 71st Rd.\nForest Hills, NY 11375\n[email protected]\nEmergency:\n24/7\nSpecialty:\nBy appointment\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nBluePearl Pet Hospital – serving Queens.\nWe are located in the Forest Hills area of Queens, and we serve pets in the neighborhoods of Astoria, Bayside, Bellerose, Corona, Elmhurst, Flushing, Fresh Meadows, Glen Oaks, Howard Beach, Jackson Heights, Jamaica, Kew Gardens, Long Island City, Middle Village, Oakland Gardens, Richmond Hill, Ridgewood, St. Albans, Sunnyside, Whitestone, Woodhaven and Woodside.\nOur reviews.\nOur services.\nWhen your pet needs emergency care, seconds count. Our team is ready to provide expert care 24/7 in case of a pet emergency. If your pet requires a veterinary specialist, we are ready for that too. Our experienced team of veterinarians, vet technicians and support staff work closely together to provide the comprehensive, compassionate care your pet needs and deserves.\nEmergency\nIn an emergency, call ahead to your BluePearl vet and let us know you’re coming. No appointment is necessary for our emergency vet.\nLearn more about your Emergency visit.\nSpecialty care\nOur veterinary specialists work directly with your primary care vet to understand your pet’s condition and develop the appropriate treatment plan. Visits to our specialists are usually by referral from your primary care vet and by appointment.\nLearn more about veterinary specialists.\nSee Specialties and Services\nOur\nveterinarians.\nCaring for your pets is our passion. Meet our team of veterinarians here to help you and your pet.\nSee Veterinarians\nAbout BluePearl Pet Hospital Queens.\nBluePearl has New York City covered with four hospitals. We have 24 hour emergency animal hospitals in Queens and Brooklyn and two in Manhattan, and we are always on duty and ready to care for your pet. If you need a board-certified expert for a chronic condition, we’re also a specialty hospital. BluePearl in Queens is the only animal hospital in New York City with hemodialysis, used to treat toxin ingestion, kidney failure and other life-threatening conditions. Located in the Forest Hills neighborhood, it has units for both dialysis and plasmapheresis.\nClients come not only from the boroughs but from upstate New York, Connecticut, and Pennsylvania. The Queens hospital location also offers total hip replacement surgery. Built in 2008, and formerly called NYC Veterinary Specialists, our Queens hospital is accessible by public transportation, and there is a parking garage in the building.\nPet owners.\nAt BluePearl Pet Hospitals, providing our customers with remarkable service is a top priority. We’re committed to making your veterinary visit as smooth as possible.\nHave questions prior to your visit? We’re happy to help. Contact our hospital team at\n718.263.0099\nor\n[email protected]\n.\nCurrent location.\n718.263.0099\n718.263.0098\n107-28 71st Rd.\nForest Hills,\nNY                                    11375\n[email protected]\nOther hospitals.\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nBrooklyn, NY\n190 Third Ave.\nBrooklyn, NY 11217\n718.596.0099\n7.90 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nDowntown NYC\nNew York, NY\n1 W 15th St.\nNew York, NY 10011\n212.924.3311\n7.97 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nMidtown NYC\nNew York, NY\n410 W 55th St.\nNew York, NY 10019\n212.767.0099\n8.23 miles\nGet In Touch\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\n2950 Busch Lake Blvd.\nTampa\n, FL\n33614\nContact Us\nFind a Hospital Near Me\nCareers at BluePearl\nBluePearl™ Cares\nWeb Accessibility\nYour Privacy Choices\nStay Connected\nHere for pets.\nWhen it matters most.\nStay connected with BluePearl for expert advice, helpful tips and trusted information to support you and your pet - delivered straight to your inbox.\nSign Up\ncookies notice\nprivacy policy\nlegal\nad choices\nterms & conditions\naccessibility\ncontact us\na\nbrand\n© 2026 BluePearl Holdings LLC. All rights reserved.\nCookie Settings",
